        {
            "id": "github-msi",
            "label": "GitHub Release · .msi installer",
            "when": "The download is an .msi. Rename it with a #/*.msi_ fragment so Scoop does not unpack it, then either Expand-MsiArchive it into $dir (portable) or hand it to msiexec (needs admin).",
